<% overview = summary[:overview] -%>
<% if overview[:rows].empty? -%>
No current incident policy matches.
<% else -%>

VPS with current matches: showing <%= overview[:rows].length %> of <%= overview[:total_count] %>; omitted <%= overview[:omitted_count] %>.
<% overview[:rows].each do |row| -%>
- VPS #<%= row[:vps_id] %> <%= row[:hostname] %> | Saved owner #<%= row[:user_id] %> <%= row[:user_login] %> | <%= row[:label] %> (<%= row[:policy_key] %>)
