- Evaluation #<%= row[:id] %> | VPS #<%= value.call(row[:vps_id]) %> <%= row[:hostname] %> | Owner #<%= value.call(row[:user_id]) %> <%= row[:user_login] %> | <%= row[:label] %> (<%= row[:policy_key] %>)
  Evaluated: <%= date.call(row[:evaluated_at]) %>; detected: <%= date.call(row[:detected_at]) %>; saved state: <%= row[:state] %>; decision: <%= row[:decision] %>.
  Saved warning threshold (7 days): <%= value.call(row[:count_7d]) %> / <%= value.call(row[:warning_limit]) %>; saved shutdown threshold (30 days): <%= value.call(row[:count_30d]) %> / <%= value.call(row[:stop_limit]) %>; saved status: <%= value.call(row[:threshold_status]) %>.
  Saved mode: <%= value.call(row[:effective_mode]) %>; automatic shutdown allowed: <%= yes_no.call(row[:stop_enforced]) %>.
