Rows with the same shutdown action ID share one VPS shutdown. A completed shutdown can have failed mail.
Mail marked sent was accepted by the mail server; this does not confirm inbox delivery. Queued, suppressed, failed and uncertain mail has no confirmed acceptance.
Activity includes recorded evaluation, shutdown and mail times and the latest update to a failed or uncertain outcome.
Outcomes may have changed after the reporting period. This history does not record every state change or retry.
The report covers a rolling 24 hours, not time since the previous successful report.
Linked views use current state and may differ from this email.
<% end -%>
<% if @vps_evidence_gains -%>
<% gains = @vps_evidence_gains; clean = ->(v) { v.to_s.gsub(/[\r\n\t]/, ' ') }; date = ->(v) { v ? local_time(v, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z') : 'not available' }; seconds = ->(us) { whole, fraction = us.divmod(1_000_000); tail = format('%06d', fraction).sub(/0+\z/, ''); "#{whole}#{tail.empty? ? '' : ".#{tail}"}" } -%>

VPS evidence credit gained
Credit accepted after <%= date.call(gains[:from]) %> and up to and including <%= date.call(gains[:to]) %>. Repeated or overlapping contributions are counted only once.
Generated at: <%= date.call(gains[:generated_at]) %>.
<% if gains[:rows].empty? -%>
No credit was recorded during this report period. This does not establish that the VPSes were monitored or healthy.
<% else -%>
<% gains[:by_signal].each do |total| -%>
- <%= clean.call(total[:label]) %> (<%= clean.call(total[:signal]) %>): <%= seconds.call(total[:accepted_us]) %> s accepted; VPS / ownership periods: <%= total[:row_count] %>.
<% end -%>
<% gains[:rows].each do |row| -%>
- VPS #<%= row[:vps_id] %><%= row[:hostname] ? " #{clean.call(row[:hostname])} (current hostname)" : '' %> | Saved owner #<%= row[:user_id] %><%= row[:user_login] ? " #{clean.call(row[:user_login])} (current login)" : '' %> | <%= clean.call(row[:label]) %> (<%= clean.call(row[:signal]) %>)
  Accepted credit: <%= seconds.call(row[:accepted_us]) %> s; ownership period start: <%= date.call(row[:accounting_since]) %>.
  First accepted: <%= date.call(row[:first_accepted_at]) %>; last accepted: <%= date.call(row[:last_accepted_at]) %>.
<% if row[:vps_url] -%>
  Current VPS details: <%= row[:vps_url] %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
Each new contribution counts toward the period in which it was accepted, including observations that arrived late. Missing observations can make these totals lower bounds. Rolling-window credit is calculated separately.
Credit is grouped by VPS and the owner at acceptance, with a separate row for each ownership period. Hostnames, logins and VPS links use current records when available.
This report covers a rolling 24-hour period, independent of when the last report was sent successfully. Separate or delayed reports can overlap or leave gaps.
<% end -%>
